{"ID":"20240314092342-u8hljo3","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314092342-u8hljo3","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314092342-u8hljo3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155221-oqnepdr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155221-1melups\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422155221-1melups\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:402,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:402\u0026#125;","title":"【瓜蒂汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422155221"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422155221-oqnepdr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240422155221-oqnepdr","updated":"20240422155221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"太阳中暍，身热疼重，而脉微弱，此以夏月伤冷水，水行皮中所致也，一物瓜蒂汤主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155221-pb2cdml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155221-pb2cdml","updated":"20240422155221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"一物瓜蒂汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155221-u34m75f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155221-u34m75f","updated":"20240422155221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"瓜蒂二十个"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155221-fahudtk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155221-fahudtk","updated":"20240422155221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右剉，以水一升，煮取五合，去滓顿服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422155221-0sf15n5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155221-0sf15n5","updated":"20240422155221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"另外一个呢，是瓜蒂散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。瓜蒂散是吐剂，你说老师为什么要用吐剂，人是中暑，你还给他吐？有原因的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155221-l78t6cz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155221-l78t6cz","updated":"20240422155221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个呢，因为这种的中暑，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"身热疼重，脉微弱"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，津液伤到了，这个是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"夏月伤冷水，水行皮中所致"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。夏天，天气很热，跳到冷水里面去，冷水把皮肤毛孔瞬间束住，束住以后呢，他渴，喝东西又喝不进去，身体没有办法受纳，汗也流不出来，所以，就成为一种真空状态。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155221-3tk0n28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155221-3tk0n28","updated":"20240422155221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这种情形的时候哦，我们为什么要用吐法？诸位这样子想：我们拿个吸管，空的吸管，放到水里面去以后，你把吸管头按到拉起来，水是不是在吸管里面？这个毛孔，因为你本来是流汗嘛，结果你再跳到水里面去，寒水把毛孔束住了，一束住以后，这个水存在中间，出又出不来，是上又上不去，进不去，水又进不去又出不来，对不对？这时候手指头一放开，水就出来了。哦，这就叫吐法。"}]},{"ID":"20240422155221-1melups","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422155221-1melups","updated":"20240422155221"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那我们很多，都是用这种原理，采用吐法。那吐法呢，瓜蒂，你说：老师，真的是瓜蒂很不好找。菜场有很多瓜蒂，那个香瓜，越甜的瓜，那个蒂越苦，拿那个瓜蒂来吃，也可以。那你说：老师，那这个为什么？因为你一吐掉，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"只要一吐的时候全身就会发微微的一层汗"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，哦，所以任何人只要有吐，都会发一点汗。那你如果说病人在太阳中暍，就是中暑了，身体津液不够的时候，你去开发表的药给他，那津液会更伤嘛！所以采吐法，一吐的话，皮肤的毛孔会发微微的汗，因为这个反刍作用，胃里面这个反刍作用，造成这样，津液就会回头。很轻的，所以如果你当个医生，你很明了病人的病情在哪里，这个时候呢，你就会用很简单的药物，一味药或两味药就可以把他救回来了。就好像我们......这个......病人的眼睛......曾经我们介绍的眼睛红肿、发炎，对不对？我要去查就看不到啊，因为都是眼屎啊，我们要查眼诊的时候看不到，那就大黄下去就看到了，就把它那个屎都给去掉。"}]}]}